@startuml
title NextBeats - High-level Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "User Browser" as Browser
component "Client cache / Prefetch" as Cache
component "Next.js App (App Router)\n- Server Components\n- Client Components\n- React Compiler" as NextApp
component "Server Functions / API Routes\n(updateTag, mutations)" as ServerFuncs
component "Audio Engine\n(lib/audio)" as Audio
component "Prisma Client\n(lib/db.ts)" as Prisma
database "Postgres / SQLite (prisma)" as DB
component "Playwright E2E (tests/)" as Playwright

Browser --> Cache : prefetch / instant nav
Cache --> NextApp : serve prefetched shell
Browser --> NextApp : navigation / requests
NextApp --> ServerFuncs : invoke mutations / updateTag
ServerFuncs --> Prisma : DB queries
Prisma --> DB : SQL
NextApp --> Audio : Web Audio UI + scheduling
Browser -> Audio : Web Audio API (client)
Playwright --> Browser : automated E2E
Playwright --> NextApp : builds/tests via pnpm

note right of NextApp
Uses Cache Components, instant(),
Server Functions and React Compiler
end note

@enduml